# inc-ibzyp: MultiSelectColorProbe mode p stages two floor items under the
# player and leaves the log open; g opens the real "Pick up what?" menu. DOWN
# then UP puts the cursor on each row once, so each row draws as a plain row.
# The @while closes a room-description box that a loaded old save may open.
@while "Winding Corridor" SPACE
g
DOWN
UP
ESC*5
@quit
